# Phase 6 (Workout Library + PWA): tell Git to treat the ingest output
# correctly across platforms.
#
# - WebPs are binary; Git should not attempt textual diff/merge.
# - manifest.json + precache-list.json must stay LF-normalized so the
#   ingest's deterministic output is byte-identical on Linux/macOS/Windows
#   (the operator may regenerate from any platform).

*.webp binary
manifest.json text eol=lf
precache-list.json text eol=lf
